# Metasploitable 2 Penetration Testing Report

## 📌 Project Overview
This project demonstrates a penetration testing assessment performed on the intentionally vulnerable **Metasploitable 2** virtual machine using the **Metasploit Framework**. The objective was to identify exploitable services, gain system access, and understand common security weaknesses in a controlled lab environment.

**Intern ID:** 2160  
**Author:** Shubham Nirmal  
**Environment:** Kali Linux → Metasploitable 2  
**Tool Used:** Metasploit Framework

